RWabi Sabi Love: The Ancient Art of Finding Perfect Love in Imperfect Relationships"�
�Love. It's right up there with air, food, and water as the most necessary of ingredients for existence. And yet it is one of the hardest things to find, and perhaps an even harder thing to hold on to.
The truth is you're not perfect, and neither is your partner. But you can be perfectly imperfect together. In Wabi Sabi Love, international bestselling author and relationship expert Arielle Ford applies the wisdom of Wabi Sabi--the ancient Japanese idea of illuminating the beauty in imperfection--to love relationships. Wabi Sabi Loveis the practice of exploring, embracing, and cherishing the quirks, irritations, and limitations that make you and your partner unique and that form your shared history as a couple.
Wabi Sabi Loveprovides the tools to see yourself, your partner, and your partnership in an entirely new light, develop a deep and profound appreciation for each other, and experience more balance, harmony, and joy in your relationship than ever before. Wabi Sabi Loveteaches you to:
turn conflict into connection and differences into mutual passions
move from "annoyed" to "enjoyed"
establish new beliefs and habits that better serve your relationship
cultivate humor, humility, and generosity to diffuse those moments when you would normally retreat or slip into tired judgments, criticisms, or resentments
Using real-life stories of couples who applied Wabi Sabi and found their relationships transformed, Wabi Sabi Lovecan revolutionize your relationship whether you're navigating financial challenges, raising children, caring for aging parents, coping with a seemingly insurmountable betrayal, or just facing mundane frustrations and everyday stressors. By shifting the focus from what's wrong to what's right, Wabi Sabi Lovereveals a pathway to true love and your happily ever after."�
�Древният път на чая: седем месеца пътешествие с последните хималайски мулетари"�	
�	Dvanaiset veka nazad, Drevniiat p't na chaia, s d'lzhina 4 000 kilometra. Edin ot nai-vazhnite t'rgovski p'tishcha v sveta. Okolo VII vek muletarite, izvestni kato ladosi, sa vazhna chast ot tozi p't ot Kitai prez Tibet, Nepal i do Indiia. Dnes vsichko zapochva, kato edna ot nai-opasnite ekspeditsii, preminava prez tri ot nai-trudnite za izkachvane v'rkhove, sledvaiki dve ot nai-visokite plata i preminavaiki rekite - Mekong, Saluin i Iandz'. Sedem iztoshchitelni mesetsa, borba s's stikhiite, neprokhodimi snegove, opasnosti. Prez vsichko tova avtor't i fotograf Dzhef Fuchs zaedno s traditsionnite muleta, izminava drevniia p't i nauchava negovite taini. Sreshcha se s poslednite zhivi ladosi. Trudnoto p'tuvane na Fuchs se prevr'shcha v edno izkliuchitelno izsledovatelsko prikliuchenie posveteno na chaia. Toi otkriva veche zabraveni ili smiatani za izcheznali vidove drevni chaeni dr'vcheta. Opitva iastiia prigotveni ot chaeni listentsa, taka, kakto sa gi praveli predi vekove. Knigata ,,Drevniiat p't na chaia" e smesitsa ot legendi, istoriia i razkazi ot p'tuvaneto na Dzhef. Bogata na podrobnosti i unikalni i prekrasni snimki, pokazvashchi zhivota na khorata po tezi mesta."�
�Vesela istoriia za detsa
,,Fridolin" e edno ot nai-chetenite i prevezhdani proizvedeniia na Frants Kaspar. Chrez neia malkite b'lgarski chitateli shche se zapoznaiat s izvestniia detski pisatel i s negoviia geroi, malkiia dakel Fridolin.
Napisana za malki detsa, v knigata se razkazva za veselite prikliucheniia na simpatichnoto kuchentse Fridolin, koeto poluchava za rozhdeniia si den ot svoia mlad gospodar nov krasiv nashiinik, no go zagubva niak'de i otchaiano tr'gva da go t'rsi.
,,Fridolin" e edna chudesna vesela istoriia, koiato se chete s goliamo uvlechenie. Zhivotnite razgovariat pomezhdu si i s khorata, a Fridolin s's svoite chisti i naivni post'pki stava simpatichen i sluzhi za primer na detsata.
Prikliucheniia, veseli istorii, kriminalni sluchki i vseki p't pobeda na dobroto i bezkoristnata liubov. Tova, zaedno s blizkiia do detsata khudozhestven stil na avtora, s bogatiia poznavatelen efekt na knigata, pravi ot ,,Fridolin" liubimo chetivo za malkite."�
�Roman't v r'tsete na chitatelia e samostoiatelen po kharakter, no kato istoricheska posledovatelnost i proslediavane na niakoi choveshki s'dbi toi e i treta, i zakliuchitelna chast na trilogiiata, zapochnata s knigite "T'teni" (1980) i "Buriata" (1986).
Kakto i p'rvite knigi ot trilogiiata, s'shcho "I stana den" e roman, no edin ot onezi istoricheski romani, v koito pochti vsichki s'bitiia i "deistvuvashchi litsa" sa deistvitelni i spomen't za tiakh se pazi v narodnata pamet ili v poiztritite prashni dokumenti ot epokhata. Tova se otnasia ne samo za krupnite istoricheski fakti, koito se znaiat ot vseki b'lgarin, khodil na uchilishche, no i za povecheto ot vtorostepennite, nagled izmisleni ot avtora. S'shchoto mozhe da se kazhe i za geroite: s'shchestvuvali sa i "igraiat" s istinskite si imena preobladavashchata chast ot tiakh -- kakto ostavilite traina diria revoliutsioneri, turski upravnitsi, uchiteli, chorbadzhii, obshchestveni deitsi i t.n., taka i bezizvestnite skromni truzhenitsi ot roda na abadzhii, drebni t'rgovtsi, slugi, zanaiatchii, ovchari i pr.
I pak kakto v "T'teni" i "Buriata", za ulesnenie na onezi chitateli, koito d'rzhat nepremenno da uznaiat tochnata granitsa mezhdu istinskoto i izmislenoto ot avtora, v kraia sa dadeni obiasnitelni belezhki (Prilozhenie I); te utochniavat faktite ili preprashchat k'm izvoroviia, ili nauchnoizsledovatelskiia material. Dobaven (Prilozhenie 2) e i krat'k rechnik na turskite i po-malko poznatite starinni dumi v knigata."�
�Kliuch't k'm dve ubiistva v artistichniia sviat na Madrid se krie v kartina ot star flamandski maistor. V kraia na petnadeseti vek khudozhnik't prevr'shcha svoiata kartina "Shakhmatnata partiia" v rebus, chieto reshenie mozhe da razkrie tainata okolo ubiistvoto na edin srednovekoven blagorodnik - i da promeni niakolko reda v uchebnitsite po istoriia.
V kraia na dvaiseti vek edna mlada zhena - restavrator na khudozhestveni proizvedeniia, edin t'rgovets na antikvarni predmeti i edin ekstsentrichen shakhmatist obediniavat usiliiata si, za da razreshat zagadkata. Okazva se obache, che tainata, zakodirana v kartinata predi pet veka, ne e zagubila sm'rtonosnata si sila. Razgadavaneto i v'vlicha geroite v opasna igra na shakh s neizvesten protivnik, v koiato zalog't e choveshki zhivot. "Flamandskiiat maistor" e predizvikatelen labirint ot logicheski zadachi i istoricheski, literaturni i muzikalni rebusi, prez koito Arturo Peres-Reverte vodi chitatelia s pochti diabolichno umenie."�
�Neveroiatno s'chetanie na grabvashcha vnimanieto istoriia oshche ot p'rvite redove, koiato ne pozvoliava na chitatelia da spre da iska oshche. Folklor, mitove i legendi, vm'knati v edin s'vremenen kontekst, izp'lnen s mistika i deistvie.
Ostanala ot mraka na drevnostta demonichna sila, koreni na koiato lezhat v drevnotrakiiski vremena, e pazena v taina ot orden, chiito predshestvenitsi sa plenenite ot tsar Kaloian prez 1205 g. ritsari, okhraniavali niakoga zemite ni. Osvoboden ot razkopki na imaniari, V'lchiiat kult shche pot'rsi iztochnika na svoiata sila, za da se v'ztsari otnovo i da pobedi Pazitelite... Sbl's'k, koito shche se provede dnes.
Sofiia e razt'rsena ot seriia brutalni ubiistva. Razsledvashchiiat inspektor Neev e prinuden da izpolzva netraditsionni resheniia, za da prosledi nishkata ot izglezhdashchi nesv'rzani edno s drugo prest'pleniia. Inspektor't, zaedno s folkloristkata i antropolozhka Irina Ivanova, se ozovavat na arenata na drevnata bitka mezhdu Mraka i Svetlinata...
